   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«というより» corrects or refines a first description: \"more than..., I'd say...\".",
     "texto": [
      "The first idea doesn't have to be entirely false; the second is presented as more precise. Pause and context help interpret the nuance.",
      "この まち は しずか という より、 おちついて います。 (This town is, more than quiet, calm.)",
      "あの ひと は せんせい という より、 そうだんやく です。 (That person is more of a counsellor than a teacher.)"
     ],
